{"id":"ese","es":"ese","en":"that (near you)","sv":"den där","pos":"other","track":"words","level":1,"themes":["conectores"],"note":"Close to the person you're talking to. Farther away than that — that's aquel."},
{"id":"aquel","es":"aquel","en":"that (over there)","sv":"den där borta","pos":"other","track":"words","level":1,"themes":["conectores"],"note":"Out of reach of both speakers — farther than ese. Spanish marks a third distance English doesn't."},
